{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000197249","approvedSymbol":"SERPINA1","functionDescriptions":["Inhibitor of serine proteases. Its primary target is elastase, but it also has a moderate affinity for plasmin and thrombin. Irreversibly inhibits trypsin, chymotrypsin and plasminogen activator. The aberrant form inhibits insulin-induced NO synthesis in platelets, decreases coagulation time and has proteolytic activity against insulin and plasmin.","[Short peptide from AAT]: Reversible chymotrypsin inhibitor. It also inhibits elastase, but not trypsin. Its major physiological function is the protection of the lower respiratory tract against proteolytic destruction by human leukocyte elastase (HLE)."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"P01009","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A0B4J278","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E9KL23","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V2B9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V387","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V4I7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V544","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V5R8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000348068","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000376802","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000376803","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000385960","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000386094","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000390299","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000408474","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000416066","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000416354","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000450561","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000451098","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000451525","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000451826","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000452169","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000452452","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000452480","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490054","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000536573","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000536574","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000536575","so